1
00:00:01,504 --> 00:00:05,000
The Dancing Dump Truck

2
00:00:14,253 --> 00:00:16,422
Hey, cool moves!

3
00:00:16,422 --> 00:00:18,457
Huh? Who the heck is that?

4
00:00:18,457 --> 00:00:20,216
No one invited you, weirdo.

5
00:00:24,131 --> 00:00:26,836
Come on, be a good sport and let me in on the fun!

6
00:00:31,137 --> 00:00:33,503
Woohoo! Hahaha!

7
00:00:34,979 --> 00:00:37,871
Huh? Hey! No fair, guys!

8
00:00:39,271 --> 00:00:39,868
Ugh...

9
00:00:42,645 --> 00:00:44,332
Save me, brave warrior!

10
00:00:44,332 --> 00:00:49,158
Wahaha! It's no use crying now!

11
00:00:49,158 --> 00:00:52,454
The world belongs to Vance, the Demon King!

12
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:58,588
Not so fast, Demon King Vance!

13
00:00:58,588 --> 00:01:00,656
Is that Jun, the warrior?

14
00:01:00,656 --> 00:01:03,899
What? How did he make his way through all of our troops?!

15
00:01:03,899 --> 00:01:07,200
Looks like I'll have to teach him a lesson myself!

16
00:01:08,534 --> 00:01:10,299
Take them on, Blue Cop!

17
00:01:15,036 --> 00:01:16,364
Aaugh!

18
00:01:21,013 --> 00:01:22,597
Mr. Warrior!

19
00:01:25,076 --> 00:01:27,441
I have come to save you, Princess Anna!

20
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:30,298
Thank you very much, Jun!

21
00:01:34,805 --> 00:01:40,006
Ahh... Princess Anna... one little kiss on this cheek too, please...

22
00:01:41,718 --> 00:01:42,599
Wake up!

23
00:01:44,935 --> 00:01:47,269
Hey, mom... good morning...

24
00:01:47,269 --> 00:01:49,140
Don't you "good morning" me!

25
00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:52,984
You promised to help out at the restaurant today, remember?

26
00:01:52,984 --> 00:01:55,289
Right, I just remembered...

27
00:01:58,888 --> 00:02:01,349
Jun, here's a cheeseburger.

28
00:02:01,659 --> 00:02:03,073
Yes, Dad.

29
00:02:03,073 --> 00:02:04,603
Table number two.

30
00:02:04,603 --> 00:02:06,331
I got it, Dad.

31
00:02:07,397 --> 00:02:09,669
One cheeseburger, coming up!

32
00:02:10,669 --> 00:02:13,195
The coffee here is the best in town. No joke.

33
00:02:13,195 --> 00:02:17,056
Saying that won't get you a free refill, officer.

34
00:02:17,556 --> 00:02:18,881
Welcome!

35
00:02:20,173 --> 00:02:22,156
Jun, I think they're here for you.

36
00:02:22,156 --> 00:02:23,634
For me?

37
00:02:23,931 --> 00:02:25,598
Come on in.

38
00:02:25,598 --> 00:02:26,900
Good day, ma'am!

39
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:28,527
Vance and Lavi?

40
00:02:28,527 --> 00:02:31,269
What are you guys doing here?

41
00:02:31,269 --> 00:02:34,908
What do you mean? This is a restaurant, we're obviously here to eat!

42
00:02:34,908 --> 00:02:36,826
That's not it!

43
00:02:36,826 --> 00:02:39,175
Sit down. We wanna talk.

44
00:02:39,175 --> 00:02:40,694
Huh? But I'm...

45
00:02:42,694 --> 00:02:48,735
Uh... Welcome, we have a corner table for two, right this way.

46
00:02:52,358 --> 00:02:54,085
What did you want to talk about?

47
00:02:56,877 --> 00:02:59,057
It's about the robot that attacked you.

48
00:02:59,957 --> 00:03:01,774
Uh... robot?

49
00:03:01,973 --> 00:03:03,893
Don't play dumb!

50
00:03:03,893 --> 00:03:07,287
We know what we saw. On that bridge over the underpass...

51
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:20,526
Well, it's...

52
00:03:21,026 --> 00:03:24,816
Jun. Please keep this a secret between us.

53
00:03:24,816 --> 00:03:26,000
Secret?

54
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:31,800
If the people of Earth find out about the Metal Cardbots, they will get frightened. I don't want to cause any trouble.

55
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,937
Don't worry, It's a promise!

56
00:03:34,437 --> 00:03:36,353
Uhhh...

57
00:03:36,353 --> 00:03:39,888
We're going to be in middle school next year! "Ah! Robots!!"

58
00:03:39,888 --> 00:03:43,359
If we went around acting like that, Anna would surely laugh at us.

59
00:03:43,359 --> 00:03:45,302
That's just like Vance was saying the other day!

60
00:03:45,302 --> 00:03:47,876
Cram it, will ya? I'm leaving!

61
00:03:48,276 --> 00:03:51,125
B-But, Vance! Don't you want to eat first?!

62
00:03:53,598 --> 00:03:54,764
Have a nice day.

63
00:03:55,463 --> 00:03:57,000
Hey, don't you want a smoothie before you go?

64
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,759
Yeah! Can I get a-

65
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:01,563
Hurry up!

66
00:04:01,563 --> 00:04:04,435
Ah, maybe next time... wait up, Vance!

67
00:04:04,435 --> 00:04:05,947
What'd they stop by for?

68
00:04:06,247 --> 00:04:07,759
Beats me.

69
00:04:08,058 --> 00:04:12,597
A giant robot was spotted in a carpark under an overpass last night.

70
00:04:12,597 --> 00:04:13,826
A giant robot?

71
00:04:13,826 --> 00:04:16,870
Here is the black box recording that became a hot topic over the Internet.

72
00:04:17,170 --> 00:04:20,737
According to an eyewitness, a dump truck approached when he and his friends were dancing...

73
00:04:20,737 --> 00:04:22,870
-That's...
-transformed into a humanoid robot, and started dancing along.

74
00:04:22,870 --> 00:04:27,134
-Wow, that video looks so real. You can do a lot with CGI these days.
- The viewers are divided over whether this video is real or fake...

75
00:04:27,134 --> 00:04:30,269
Yeah... it looks like a movie, haha...

76
00:04:30,269 --> 00:04:34,800
I heard the new Max Force movie is coming out soon. Whaddya say I take you to go see it?

77
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:36,360
Ah! Dear!

78
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:39,028
Yes- Oh, oh no!

79
00:04:39,028 --> 00:04:40,838
That's coming out of your paycheck!

80
00:04:40,838 --> 00:04:42,819
Oh no, not again!

81
00:04:51,822 --> 00:04:54,319
There's no mistaking it. That's Mega Trucker.

82
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:55,209
Is that right?

83
00:04:55,209 --> 00:04:59,175
I told him over and over again to lay low and not attract the attention of the natives.

84
00:04:59,175 --> 00:05:03,149
What are you going to do? This already has over a million views, it's gone viral!

85
00:05:03,149 --> 00:05:05,338
He won't listen to me anyway.

86
00:05:05,338 --> 00:05:07,302
We'll just have to seal him.

87
00:05:07,302 --> 00:05:08,569
Seal him?

88
00:05:08,769 --> 00:05:12,952
With the power of the Metal Breath, you can seal a Metal Cardbot inside a Metal Card.

89
00:05:15,353 --> 00:05:18,956
In any case, I need to try to convince Mega Trucker once more.

90
00:05:18,956 --> 00:05:22,588
Yeah, but to do that, we have to go find him first...

91
00:05:24,009 --> 00:05:27,387
Jun. Do you think you could procure a large speaker?

92
00:05:27,387 --> 00:05:28,555
A speaker?

93
00:05:28,555 --> 00:05:30,526
I think I have an idea.

94
00:05:36,298 --> 00:05:41,310
It's hard waking up so early. This will be over before school, right?

95
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:45,060
For this plan to work, we'll have to do it while it's quiet out, and when no one's watching.

96
00:05:45,060 --> 00:05:47,110
If you're tired, I can make you some coffee when this is done.

97
00:05:47,110 --> 00:05:50,968
I'm too young to drink coffee- wait, you know how to make coffee?

98
00:05:54,668 --> 00:06:00,692
Mega Trucker loves music. His favorite is Musica Latina.

99
00:06:00,692 --> 00:06:03,262
He can't help but dance anytime he hears it.

100
00:06:03,262 --> 00:06:04,250
How about that?

101
00:06:05,829 --> 00:06:07,086
That's perfect.

102
00:06:15,598 --> 00:06:17,040
Let's turn up the volume.

103
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,069
Alright.

104
00:06:24,081 --> 00:06:26,473
Don't you think this is too loud?

105
00:06:26,473 --> 00:06:27,860
It's not loud enough.

106
00:06:45,028 --> 00:06:49,132
Woohoo! This is just my kind of music! Beep Beep!

107
00:06:49,132 --> 00:06:50,336
He actually showed up?!

108
00:06:50,336 --> 00:06:52,590
Let me in on the fun!

109
00:06:56,468 --> 00:06:57,504
Hehehe!

110
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:05,875
This is great! Step on the gas and let's dance the night away!

111
00:07:08,031 --> 00:07:11,524
Mega Trucker! I told you to lay low and not be seen by anyone!

112
00:07:11,524 --> 00:07:13,298
Why won't you listen?!

113
00:07:14,533 --> 00:07:20,042
You can be boring if you want! I'll live my life dancing and having fun!

114
00:07:21,589 --> 00:07:22,903
Jun, get back!

115
00:07:27,843 --> 00:07:30,625
Hey! Bring the music back!

116
00:07:30,819 --> 00:07:33,598
I can't let you destroy Uncle Edo's repair shop!

117
00:07:33,954 --> 00:07:35,278
Who's this kid, anyway?

118
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:42,272
We have lost our home and have no choice but to live here on this planet!

119
00:07:42,272 --> 00:07:44,803
We must learn to get along with the people of Earth, like this boy!

120
00:07:45,404 --> 00:07:49,992
Shut up! Don't you tell me what to do ever again!

121
00:07:54,593 --> 00:07:55,725
Blue Cop!

122
00:07:59,487 --> 00:08:01,456
Blue Cop! Are you alright?

123
00:08:02,165 --> 00:08:04,820
I guess we have no choice. We'll have to seal him.

124
00:08:06,220 --> 00:08:09,993
Jun! The time has come for us to fight.

125
00:08:13,672 --> 00:08:18,068
So it's come to this. Stay calm... what should I do?

126
00:08:18,268 --> 00:08:20,032
Mega Power Tackle!

127
00:08:20,032 --> 00:08:23,247
Alright- Huh? Look out, Blue Cop!

128
00:08:27,669 --> 00:08:28,767
Now, Jun!

129
00:08:32,282 --> 00:08:33,764
Blue Cop, setup!

130
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:56,456
Huh? So you do know how to fight!

131
00:08:59,288 --> 00:09:01,114
Uhh... T-Thunderbolt Smash!

132
00:09:01,114 --> 00:09:03,569
Thunderbolt Smaaaa-

133
00:09:07,275 --> 00:09:09,186
Uhh..heheh... sorry...

134
00:09:09,386 --> 00:09:12,399
Hahaha! How pathetic!

135
00:09:13,446 --> 00:09:16,110
After all that talk, you can't even throw a punch?

136
00:09:16,110 --> 00:09:17,048
Blue Cop!

137
00:09:17,048 --> 00:09:20,139
Jun, I'm okay! Just give me the next command!

138
00:09:22,899 --> 00:09:25,413
Blue Cop, Burst Shot!

139
00:09:26,357 --> 00:09:27,792
Burst Shot!

140
00:09:31,806 --> 00:09:32,908
Great!

141
00:09:32,908 --> 00:09:35,834
Burst Shot, Burst Shot, Burst Shot!

142
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:46,703
This is the end!

143
00:09:48,373 --> 00:09:51,074
Megabolt Punch!

144
00:09:54,166 --> 00:09:55,208
Megabolt...

145
00:09:59,908 --> 00:10:01,010
Punch!!

146
00:10:09,092 --> 00:10:10,948
Jun, seal him now!

147
00:10:10,948 --> 00:10:14,264
N-Now? Alright...

148
00:10:15,666 --> 00:10:19,314
Metal Cardbot... Change Up!

149
00:10:36,549 --> 00:10:39,625
Mega Trucker... sealed!

150
00:10:41,558 --> 00:10:43,768
Well done, Jun. You did it.

151
00:10:45,006 --> 00:10:47,911
Mega Trucker really turned into a card...

152
00:10:47,911 --> 00:10:52,494
Correct. He has become a Metal Card and can now be stored within the Metal Breath.

153
00:10:52,494 --> 00:10:56,160
You can summon Mega Trucker any time you want with that card,

154
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:58,111
and you can give him commands too.

155
00:11:01,199 --> 00:11:03,936
What's going on? What was that just now?

156
00:11:03,936 --> 00:11:04,724
Uhh...

157
00:11:04,724 --> 00:11:06,651
Uh, Uncle Edo...

158
00:11:06,651 --> 00:11:09,460
This is bad...

